{{Navbar-Global Gas Infrastructure Tracker}}
'''Guardian Gas Pipeline''' is a natural gas pipeline running from Illinois to Wisconsin. <ref name=source1>[https://dlz.com/projects/guardian-pipeline-interstate-transmission-project/ "Guardian Pipeline Interstate Transmission Project",] DLZ, accessed January 2018</ref>

==Location==
The pipeline runs from Joliet, Illinois, to Ixonia, Wisconsin. <ref name=source1>[https://dlz.com/projects/guardian-pipeline-interstate-transmission-project/ "Guardian Pipeline Interstate Transmission Project",] DLZ, accessed January 2018</ref>

{{#display_map:
|lines=41.527325, -88.117221:43.144336, -88.597425|center=41.831344, -87.683941|width=400|height=300|type=normal|zoom=6}}

